Corrective fix: No network changes are required. If file sharing still fails, investigate host/application layers: verify the sharing service is running on the target host, confirm both hosts’ local firewalls allow the required ports/protocols, and re-test with the specific application ports (e.g., SMB/445, SSH/22, or your chosen sharing tool). From the network perspective, the segment is operating normally. === END ===